#: ../../../source/Releases/Release-Lyrical-Luth.rst:817
msgid "Dual session tracing"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Releases/Release-Lyrical-Luth.rst:819
msgid ""
"`Dual session mode <https://github.com/ros2/ros2_tracing/tree/lyrical#dual-"
"session-tracing>`_ solves the problem of losing initialization trace data by "
"using two separate tracing sessions: one for initialization events in "
"snapshot mode, and another normal tracing session for runtime events. This "
"allows starting to actively record trace data at any point without losing "
"initialization data."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Releases/Release-Lyrical-Luth.rst:822
msgid ""
"Use the ``Trace`` action with ``dual_session=True`` to start the "
"initialization data session in snapshot mode. Then use the trace commands "
"with ``--dual-session`` option to take a snapshot of the initialization "
"session and start the runtime session."
msgstr ""

